["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"REPLAY: The Story of Apple Pay | Jennifer Bailey (2024) tokenization open loop open banking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-24-a16z-apple-pay-上线时美国非接受理率只有3-靠谁推了它一把/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>Apple Pay 上线时美国非接受理率只有3%，靠谁推了它一把</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Apple 先做了更难的线下支付而不是线上，并从一开始就设计成看不到用户的交易数据，用隐私换来了银行和网络的信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">移动支付</span><span class=\"tag\">隐私架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why popular parenting strategies don&#x27;t work for every child: Understanding sensitive nervous systems with Robyn Gobbel owl / watchdog / possum felt safety neurosequential model of therapeutics scaffolding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-24-secureattach-孩子的崩溃不是因为那一刻-是压力水位早已蓄满/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">55:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>孩子的崩溃不是因为那一刻，是压力水位早已蓄满</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个孩子今天能忍住同样的吵闹声，明天却因此打人——差的不是那一刻的刺激，而是神经系统里压力水位是否已经逼近临界点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Jensen Huang&#x27;s Stunning Return Means for the AI Trade dead cat bounce short gamma neoclouds\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-24-oddlots-黄仁勋复职引发暴力反弹-但分析师说问题一个没解决/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋复职引发暴力反弹，但分析师说问题一个没解决</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barclays策略师称这次反弹不是靠基本面逆转，而是空头回补和低流动性共同作用的结果，AI融资和营收的结构性问题从昨天到今天没有任何变化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Selling $40 of paper for $43: how ATMs actually work Durbin Amendment / Regulation II Reg E / Electronic Funds Transfer Act off-premise ATM interchange\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-24-complexsys-atm取现是在加价买纸-那些机器悄悄长成了银行卡支付网络/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08265d0cb7ece5d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">35:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>ATM取现是在加价买纸：那些机器悄悄长成了银行卡支付网络</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ATM的本质不是取款而是花钱买纸，运营这门生意的公司意外发现自己手握的其实是一条支付轨道，比卖纸赚钱得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">ATM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 228 Sugar Part 1: No sugarcoating humoral theory sugar beet high-fructose corn syrup\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-24-tpwky-从每年2磅到90磅-糖如何靠奴隶贸易和营销占领人类餐桌/\">\n<div clas