l=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">32:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>换尿布时你等的「配合」，其实是孩子在等你喊停</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多父母以为尊重孩子就是耐心等待他配合换尿布、让他拿着玩具，Janet Lansbury 说这其实是没有照顾好自己——孩子真正需要的是父母主动设限、及时喊停。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿方法</span><span class=\"tag\">设限</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"‘Mom Magic’ Isn&#x27;t Enough, and Other Holiday Myths survival mode\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-24-goodinside-妈妈的魔法不在游乐园-而在沙发上没有安排的几分钟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">25:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>妈妈的魔法不在游乐园，而在沙发上没有安排的几分钟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">节目主理人认为节日魔法不是来自礼物和活动，而是来自没有干扰时父母给孩子的全部注意力；同时，容忍失望才是通往感恩的唯一路径。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子教育</span><span class=\"tag\">节日家庭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CrowdStrike CEO: AI Cyberattack Wave, Hyperspeed Hacks, &amp; The Patching Problem CVE session token Pyramid of Pain Artex\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-24-allin-补丁已追不上漏洞-ai-让任何人都能拥有国家级黑客能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/da3b8bbd84f4db4a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">53:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>补丁已追不上漏洞：AI 让任何人都能拥有国家级黑客能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">CrowdStrike CEO 说，AI 让漏洞发现量暴涨、攻击链自动拼接，防守方的补丁节奏已经撞上「音速屏障」，攻守失衡正在从理论变成日常宕机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI攻防</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trump&#x27;s Mission to Get Jensen Huang Back at Nvidia key man risk honeypotted\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-24-hardfork-黄仁勋被解职又复职-特朗普一通电话逆转董事会的决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">26:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋被解职又复职：特朗普一通电话逆转董事会的决定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特朗普认定黄仁勋的命运直接牵动美股大盘，于是让万斯周末出面游说董事会，无视情报部门关于其绯闻对象是中国间谍的警告，换来英伟达股价一天暴涨一万亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Emergency Pod: Jensen Back FDPR Entity List NeoCloud\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-chinatalk-特朗普让英伟达ceo复职-交换条件可能是放弃对华芯片管制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d92f3d1b0b6af598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普让英伟达CEO复职，交换条件可能是放弃对华芯片管制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达董事会原本因出口管制违规调查而考虑让黄仁勋承担个人连带责任，特朗普介入使他复职，换来的很可能是过去违规的赦免与未来对华许可的默许放行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Return of Jensen Huang imperial CEO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-wsjournal-黄仁勋罢免又复职-董事会说国家安全风险已排除-却拿不出任何证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1e083f7c32c0f8e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋罢免又复职：董事会说国家安全风险已排除，却拿不出任何证据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达董事会用十天把「对黄仁勋展开国家安全调查」变成「没有国家安全风险」，中间唯一能确认的变量是特朗普亲自介入——没有调查报告，没有数据，没有任何公开证据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Music and Your Mind reminiscence bump bi-musical ISO principle flow state\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-hiddenbrain-两位教授想让你第一次听时就带着故事去听-不是去分析和弦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>两位教授想让你第一次听时就带着故事去听，不是去分析和弦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">音乐心理学家发现，听众对同一段从未听过的陌生乐曲会不约而同地想象出几乎相同的故事场景，说明意义不在音符里，而是大脑对声音模式与生活情境关系的统计追踪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">音乐心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">认知科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to make climate anxiety your superpower | Cooked Ep 3 eco anxiety efficacy beliefs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-naturepod-气候焦虑的解药不是个人减碳-是找到同伴一起行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb2f3d103db50796-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">30:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>气候焦虑的解药不是个人减碳，是找到同伴一起行动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">顶尖气候科学家说，个人少用塑料袋没用；真正有效的是用投票和集体行动改变系统，而焦虑本身可以是推动行动的燃料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span><span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frederick Law Olmsted, Part 1 Greensward Plan Free Soil Movement Seneca Village\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-stuffmissed-设计中央公园的人曾自掏腰包给堪萨斯自由州民兵买过一门炮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>设计中央公园的人曾自掏腰包给堪萨斯自由州民兵买过一门炮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在成为景观建筑师之前，Olmsted 当过农民、记者和军火筹款人——他为《纽约时报》写南方见闻时亲眼改变了对奴隶制的看法，又为堪萨斯的反奴隶制民兵买了一门榴弹炮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史人物</span><span class=\"tag\">城市公园</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Pornography Invented the Attention Economy, with Patricia Nilsson data-driven creativity parasocial relations affiliate marketing camming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-iq2-色情网站先于大厂学会了用点击数据制造令人上瘾的内容/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/062e73a03ab52389-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">35:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>色情网站先于大厂学会了用点击数据制造令人上瘾的内容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">90年代色情内容率先实现免费、用户生成与数据驱动创作，这套「用点击率反推内容」的逻辑后来成了整个互联网平台经济的底层模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">注意力经济</span><span class=\"tag\">算法推荐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"375 | Karen Lutfey Spencer on Dying and How to Prepare for It hospice palliative care advance directive medical aid in dying Palliative Performance Scale\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-mindscape-七成美国人想在家去世-只有三成做到-差距来自医疗系统的默认设置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>七成美国人想在家去世，只有三成做到：差距来自医疗系统的默认设置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">医院和医疗体系的默认选项是不断治疗，而不是在恰当时机喊停；临终关怀转介平均只提前18天，等于大多数人没时间用上它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">临终关怀</span><span class=\"tag\">医疗体系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Roland Fryer’s Relentless Search for Truth\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-econtalk-经济学家设百万美元奖金-奖励敢讲真话却得罪人的学者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>经济学家设百万美元奖金，奖励敢讲真话却得罪人的学者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Roland Fryer 与 Bill Ackman 设立 Carob Trust Prize，奖励那些诚实分析数据、即便结论不受欢迎、事后被证明站得住脚的社会科学家，核心是对抗学术界的自我审查。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">学术自由</span><span class=\"tag\">同行评审</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The One-Person Biotech | OpenAI Life Sciences capability overhang harness chain of evidence / chain of custody CMC trusted access\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-a16z-openai押注一人生物科技公司-2000个智能体替人类做实验分析/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI押注一人生物科技公司：2000个智能体替人类做实验分析</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI life sciences负责人认为生物学的瓶颈不是数据太少，而是人类注意力有限；用上万智能体并行扫描数据，能找到人类十几二十年都没发现的洞见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">药物研发</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.294｜当凯撒遇见MAGA：用罗马史读懂美国中期选举｜主播：施展\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-cn27f438-凯撒联合失地平民架空元老院-这套剧本正在美国重演/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">49:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>凯撒联合失地平民架空元老院，这套剧本正在美国重演</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">川普联合铁锈地带平民反建制派，与凯撒当年联合失地罗马平民架空元老院是同一套逻辑；这次中期选举的民主党大翻盘，不过是乱世里一次应激性的回摆。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"We Gambled Away $10K on DraftKings … on Purpose loss chasing parlay micro bet cool-off period VIP host\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-papertrail-记者故意输掉一万美元-换来的是draftkings的vip邀请而非预警/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ab8a5a4c0feb5c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">46:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>记者故意输掉一万美元，换来的是DraftKings的VIP邀请而非预警</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ProPublica记者刻意模仿问题赌徒的下注轨迹做实验，结果输钱行为被DraftKings的VIP系统当作「有价值客户」的信号，责任博彩提示和加码奖励几乎同时发到他手机上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育博彩</span><span class=\"tag\">成瘾机制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What a Town Full of Vibecoders Says About the Chinese Economy RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) dark forest OPC (one-person company) Bazi AIGC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-oddlots-中国人拥抱ai不是因为乐观-是因为没有拒绝的选项/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>中国人拥抱AI不是因为乐观，是因为没有拒绝的选项</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民调显示83%中国人认为AI对生活工作有益，远高于美国的38%，但记者说这种乐观很大程度上是因为人们别无选择，而不是真正的信心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI扩散</span><span class=\"tag\">良渚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"LISTEN NOW: My Mom&#x27;s Murder Season 2 cocaine-induced agitated delirium\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-tides-母亲案发证据被销毁-法医仍坚持可卡因致死说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1e9bb828430258f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">10:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Tides of History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>母亲案发证据被销毁，法医仍坚持可卡因致死说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">等了22个月的DNA结果换来的是：头发、酒杯、指甲下的DNA从未送检或已被销毁，而法医在两次毒检都显示「干净」的情况下，仍倾向于认定死因是可卡因引发的谵妄。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真实犯罪</span><span class=\"tag\">冷案调查</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Berlin Airlift Little Lift Iron Curtain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-historyhit-柏林空运靠的不只是飞机-是把敌人变盟友的心理战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ce644f80fce9ba8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">34:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>柏林空运靠的不只是飞机：是把敌人变盟友的心理战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">斯大林切断柏林陆路想困死西方占领区，英美却用一年30万架次空运撑住了城市，顺带把德国人从战败敌人变成了冷战盟友。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">柏林空运</span>\n</div></div></a>"]